## Repository Structure

```
constellai/
├── constellai/
│   ├── orbital_mechanics/      # M1: propagation, frames, perturbations, conjunction geometry
│   ├── graph/                  # M2: graph construction, temporal windowing
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── tgnn/                # M3
│   │   └── marl/                # M4
│   ├── simulation/             # M5: ground-truth simulator, scenario generation
│   └── common/                  # shared constants, types, config schemas
├── experiments/
│   └── configs/                 # one YAML per experiment run
├── tests/
│   ├── unit/
│   ├── integration/
│   └── physics_validation/
├── notebooks/                    # exploratory only — never source of truth for results
├── docs/
│   ├── adr/                     # Architecture Decision Records
│   └── research_log/            # weekly lab notebook
├── scripts/
└── paper/                        # LaTeX source, figures, tables
```

---

## Contributing

- Branch naming: `feature/<module>-<short-desc>`
- PRs target `develop`, never `main`
- PRs introducing a new model, physics assumption, or reward formulation: tag `needs-science-review`
- Tag `main` at each monthly milestone (`v0.1-m1-baseline`, etc.) — these become the paper's reproducibility pointers
- No hyperparameters hardcoded in code — all experiment configs live in `experiments/configs/`

See [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](CONTRIBUTING.md) for full guidelines.

